		{"id":"0837f06c881ea677","type":"text","text":"***Cryptographic*** Hashing function:\n- Deterministic    \n- Efficient.\n- **Preimage resistance**\n- **Second preimage resistance**\n- **Collision resistance**\n- Avalanche effect\n- Fixed output length\n\nEsempio di applicazioni:\n- [[Integrity]]\n- Digital signatures *(we will see it later)* \n- Passwords *(we will see it later)*\n- Key derivation functions ([[KDF]])\n- Blockchain\n- Privacy\n- Disk optimization\n- PRNG *(we will see it later)*\n- ","x":-1997,"y":-329,"width":400,"height":359,"color":"2"},
